msgid ""
"Pausing keeps the picture as it is and costs no power. Drawing continues "
"where it stopped."
msgstr ""
"一時停止すると画面はそのままになり、電力も消費しません。描画は止まった場所か"
"ら再開します。"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "パフォーマンス"

msgid "Power"
msgstr "電源"

msgid "Preview"
msgstr "プレビュー"

msgid "Rainbow (every connection gets its own color)"
msgstr "レインボー (接続ごとに別の色)"

